      "commit": "3b8192f1acc58dd8f48a1fe2d83b46d2cbb53af5",
      "dependencies": {},
      "notes": "The first release.\n\n- Haptics for weapons, flight, heat, jumps, docking, landings, shields and hits: 97 feels, each with its own level.\n- R2 and L2 follow the situation: hardpoints out, reloading, an empty weapons capacitor, overheating, analysis mode, an interdiction, a hit, the SRV turret, on foot.\n- The lightbar shows your hull and the ship's state; the player LEDs show the fire group and the jump countdown; the mic LED shows low fuel and silent running.\n- Gyro aim pauses in the main menu and in the panels and maps you pick.\n- Reads shields, heat and weapon lists from the HUD.\n- Pages in Bururu: Effects (Haptics, Triggers, Lights) and Settings (HUD reader, In menus, Elite's files).\n- Hook points for add-ons: `weapon_layer@1`, `turn@1`, `heat@1`, `boost@1` and `state@1`.\n- Needs Bururu with mod API 0.10.",
